    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Recheck"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " after any dose change, a new interacting drug (diuretics, NSAIDs, renin-angiotensin system antagonists, metronidazole), a marked change in strenuous exercise, or a new illness."
